{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HcmlzZWxkYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv","type":"series","name":"Griselda","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nhEtK1lJKb3kqBtDBDXynGr3hJL.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nj06Yo0yVzI7jx6novjyGOyNQKC.jpg","description":"Inspired by real events, this fictional dramatization shows Griselda Blanco's journey from Medellín to becoming \"the Godmother\" of Miami's drug empire.\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 6/6","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Drama","Crime","Hindi"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HcmlzZWxkYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.1","title":"Lady Comes to Town","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2024-01-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Griselda flees Medellín for Miami to make a fresh start. With her sons and a hidden cache in tow, she seizes a chance to establish her own business.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xxDH9CgYp5oVvtV0NxcWxOlXIfv.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HcmlzZWxkYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.2","title":"Rich White People","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2024-01-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Griselda welcomes some well-supplied Medellín associates to Miami, but an enemy isn't far behind. A night out fuels a bold plan to tap into a new market.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7Z7qbB41AHpAgebhT9XB6VDx25R.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HcmlzZWxkYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.3","title":"Mutiny","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-01-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After Griselda receives a tempting offer from a big-time supplier, she tries to win over a business rival and earn the trust of the local dealers.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/463RHPPJYe7v4Y3YrYcHyv0HYGq.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HcmlzZWxkYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.4","title":"Middle Management","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-01-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Griselda hides out in a secure compound and prepares to make her move against the Ochoas. June joins an elite tactical unit targeting drug traffickers.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ry7SLjjFi3BqLiJTgnGlscfpcu2.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HcmlzZWxkYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.5","title":"Paradise Lost","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-01-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Griselda suspects there's an informant in her ranks as June and CENTAC gain ground. A lavish, coke-fueled birthday party descends into chaos.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q32mLZhJnRuHjDRIJQ5OVaM3m9b.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HcmlzZWxkYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.6","title":"Adios, Miami","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-01-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Feeling pressure from all sides, Griselda gets out of Miami. But with her options dwindling and enemies closing in, can she outrun fate?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eyuPr2Bx5P8l3SlWaFDcnxw2kPr.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"7.2","cast":["Sofía Vergara","Alberto Guerra","Christian Tappan","Martín Rodríguez","Juliana Aidén Martinez","Vanessa Ferlito","Alberto Ammann","José Velázquez"],"director":["Ingrid Escajeda","Carlo Bernard"],"released":"2024-01-25T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"A woman of substance.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Sofía Vergara","character":"Griselda Blanco","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/l79eVtn6bSOaiq7R0UGu60foMrK.jpg"},{"name":"Alberto Guerra","character":"Dario","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aqckvbjXVGeFlx27FJevoby9WBM.jpg"},{"name":"Christian Tappan","character":"Arturo","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AsgxuVkpzSE4uC4iQCS4WNMQhEC.jpg"},{"name":"Martín Rodríguez","character":"Rivi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/12O2gPSiu5G4gg5e5bOsa